    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισταθμ-εία</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισταθμ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
